# A non-Wall blocker survives combat and is not destroyed at end of combat (CR 603.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Battering Ram
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Kraken Hatchling
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Battering Ram.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
